        this aggregator has none. Project-wide threshold enforcement
        will land in a follow-up ticket together with the run-scripts
        (per the testing-foundational rule) and may use an external
        coverage gate or jacoco-merge+check pattern targeted at one of
        the leaf modules. The per-module reports already produced by
        the parent's <build><plugins> jacoco entry are unaffected.
